# Variation 6: Ca 50, Cl 100, then equilibrate at 100C, then cool to 25C
SOLUTION 6
    temp 100
    units mmol/kgw
    Ca 50
    Cl 100
EQUILIBRIUM_PHASES 6
    Calcite 0 10
    Aragonite 0 10
    Gypsum 0 10
    CO2(g) 0 10
    CH4(g) 0.69897 10
    H2S(g) 1.0 10
REACTION_TEMPERATURE 2
    25
END
